    <div class="infoBox-content" style="padding:2%;">
        <p>
            <h4>ABOUT US:</h4> <span style="padding-left: 20px;">Marshall Area Stage Co. is a theatre organization formed in 
            1999. In cooperation with Marshall Community Services, and with the assistance 
            of Marshall Area Fine Arts Council, (MAFAC), we hope to continue providing 
            annual productions and theatre workshops while supporting other art functions.
            We are proud to enhance the cultural environment this area offers.</span></p>
        <p>
            <h4>OUR MISSION:</h4> <span style="padding-left: 20px;">is to encourage the growth of the performing 
            arts in Marshall &amp; surrounding communities.</span>
        </p>
        <p><h4>OUR GOAL:</h4> <span style="padding-left: 20px;">is to enrich, entertain and educate Southwest 
            Minnesota!</span>
        </p>
